    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin is an add-on for the also free <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/advanced-ads/\" rel=\"ugc\">Advanced Ads</a> ad management plugin. It extends the plugin with a placement to put Google AdSense In-feed ads in the loop between posts on your homepage, category pages, tag pages, or other archive pages, etc.</p>\n<p>Google AdSense InFeed ads are a dedicated Google AdSense ad type to monetize such post lists pages with a highly engaging layout and specialized options.</p>\n<p>Advanced Ads was developed to place, manage and test ads on pages to increase revenue and usability.</p>\n<p>The plugin comes with plenty of features, e.g.,</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Support for all Google AdSense types like link units, responsive, In-feed, In-article and matched content</li>\n<li>Google AdSense term violation checks</li>\n<li>Google AdSense Auto ads</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://wpadvancedads.com/features/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Full feature list</a></p>\n<p>Advanced Ads Pro and other add-on features include</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ads on AMP pages (all ads, not only Google AdSense ads)</li>\n<li>ads based on specific browser widths</li>\n<li>showing an alternative ad to ad block users</li>\n<li>click fraud monitoring to protect your Google AdSense account</li>\n<li>position tests</li>\n<li>support for caching plugins</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>2.1.1 (September 23, 2025)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Improvement: add undefined translations</li>\n<li>Fix: prevent fatal error when handling invalid ads</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.1.0 (June 23, 2025)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Improvement: add undefined translations</li>\n<li>Improvement: Test plugin compatibility with WordPress 6.8.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Feature: achieve full compatibility with Advanced Ads 2.0</li>\n<li>Improvement: enhance performance and efficiency with new codebase</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix: update plugin icons</li>\n<li>Fix: update plugin description</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>ensure compatibility with WP 5.8</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>coding style optimized</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>fixed frontend issue when Advanced Ads basic plugin is not activated</li>\n<li>use default index of 1 if placement position wasn’t saved before</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>first version</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Display Google AdSense In-feed ads between posts.",
    "description": "<p>This plugin is an add-on for the also free <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/advanced-ads/\" rel=\"ugc\">Advanced Ads</a> ad management plugin. It extends the plugin with a placement to put Google AdSense In-feed ads in the loop between posts on your homepage, category pages, tag pages, or other archive pages, etc.</p>\n<p>Google AdSense InFeed ads are a dedicated Google AdSense ad type to monetize such post lists pages with a highly engaging layout and specialized options.</p>\n<p>Advanced Ads was developed to place, manage and test ads on pages to increase revenue and usability.</p>\n<p>The plugin comes with plenty of features, e.g.,</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Support for all Google AdSense types like link units, responsive, In-feed, In-article and matched content</li>\n<li>Google AdSense term violation checks</li>\n<li>Google AdSense Auto ads</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://wpadvancedads.com/features/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Full feature list</a></p>\n<p>Advanced Ads Pro and other add-on features include</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ads on AMP pages (all ads, not only Google AdSense ads)</li>\n<li>ads based on specific browser widths</li>\n<li>showing an alternative ad to ad block users</li>\n<li>click fraud monitoring to protect your Google AdSense account</li>\n<li>position tests</li>\n<li>support for caching plugins</li>\n</ul>\n",
